  <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock id="f-29" contextRef="c-1">&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;8. Management and general contract (union) wage increase during Q1 2026 are as follows:&lt;br/&gt;Management - Evergy Metro management merit average increase of 3.25% was effective 3/1/2026.&lt;br/&gt;IBEW Local 1464 - 3.25% increase effective February 1, 2026.&lt;br/&gt;IBEW Local 412 - 3.25% effective March 1, 2026.&lt;/span&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock>
