  <ferc:DescriptionAndPurposeOfOtherRegulatoryAssets id="f-496" contextRef="c-50">Kansas Docket No. 04-KCPE-1025-GIE: Represents the deferred costs for the energy efficiency and affordability programs as provided in the Kansas Corporation Commission order. These costs will be recovered through an Energy Efficiency Rider to be filed by March 31 of each year to recover costs incurred during the previous calendar year.&#160; Costs are to be amortized over 1 year starting each July.</ferc:DescriptionAndPurposeOfOtherRegulatoryAssets>
